{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/1272513c09b637add0502ed0bf104199.avif?t=1759954824\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 2126. Earth was warned. No one listened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classified signal pulsed from deep space. Governments dismissed it. Corporations buried it. And then it struck. Not a meteor. Not a bomb. Something alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within hours, entire cities were swallowed by black storms, and from the mist came \u201cThe Entity\u201d\u2014a colossal, unknowable lifeform accompanied by swarms of horrors and tall purging droids, tearing through concrete and bone alike. One city remains\u2014a collapsing stronghold of screaming civilians, and dying hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/40024f90f63987ddf51ffcd0f1c2ea75.avif?t=1759954824\" width=394 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/7a60bd46ee5e2aacfcb6a23362b8fd8f.poster.avif?t=1759954824\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/7a60bd46ee5e2aacfcb6a23362b8fd8f.webm?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/7a60bd46ee5e2aacfcb6a23362b8fd8f.mp4?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Ranger: Markus 4516, a Tier-0 super-soldier deployed under Directive X\u2014the final protocol. Alongside your dwindling squad of elite operators, you\u2019re dropped into a ruined warzone with one goal: buy humanity time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/deaf0cfede6e1d59814670de066339b4.avif?t=1759954824\" width=388 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/81b6bf7a75cecce0a50306cb001f1cb9.poster.avif?t=1759954824\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/81b6bf7a75cecce0a50306cb001f1cb9.webm?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/81b6bf7a75cecce0a50306cb001f1cb9.mp4?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight waves of enemy forces and track a monster that rewrites the laws of nature with every step. As the skies darken and reality fractures, you\u2019ll uncover a horrifying truth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/f8a63db80e8758dad9791eca066291bd.avif?t=1759954824\" width=378 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/46258209da8e5efada0cc3e58f47e2d9.poster.avif?t=1759954824\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/46258209da8e5efada0cc3e58f47e2d9.webm?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/46258209da8e5efada0cc3e58f47e2d9.mp4?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t an invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/d1d32632eededf90966e0cbaa03402bf.avif?t=1759954824\" width=386 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/e9023c9264d92435962dde7f3f77db45.poster.avif?t=1759954824\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/e9023c9264d92435962dde7f3f77db45.webm?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/e9023c9264d92435962dde7f3f77db45.mp4?t=1759954824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/extras/6689f1f209de7ab30e62ab44e8100fa6.avif?t=1759954824\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Sci-Fi Combat</strong>: Immerse yourself in a visually intense, story-driven shooter set in a city collapsing under the weight of a monstrous unknown threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Monster Encounters</strong>: Face off against towering creatures in dynamic battles that blend FPS precision with cinematic scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible Environments</strong><br>Buildings collapse. Vehicles explode. Encounters tear through the map as you adapt your strategy to the evolving battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Timer Pressure System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent countdown intensifies every battle. Survive escalating waves and complete critical objectives before reinforcements are overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found Footage Combat Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through intense missions as if you're inside a military-grade bodycam recording. Visual distortions, audio glitches, and UI overlays enhance the sense of realism and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Weather Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through dynamic rainstorms, sand clouds, and thick fog \u2014 impacting visibility, sound, and enemy tracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter Zones</strong><br>Every map contains <strong>dynamic spawns</strong>, <strong>shifting objectives</strong>, and <strong>roaming bosses</strong>, making each run unpredictable and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807670?t=1759954824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/1dd2c33cbb06fbd2169bdcd353eb78e325c5d50b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759954824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/0ea5902d437a4b5140a154ef8633e3d76a0b49ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759954824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/0ea5902d437a4b5140a154ef8633e3d76a0b49ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759954824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio