\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Sci-Fi Combat</strong>: Immerse yourself in a visually intense, story-driven shooter set in a city collapsing under the weight of a monstrous unknown threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Monster Encounters</strong>: Face off against towering creatures in dynamic battles that blend FPS precision with cinematic scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible Environments</strong><br>Buildings collapse. Vehicles explode. Encounters tear through the map as you adapt your strategy to the evolving battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Timer Pressure System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent countdown intensifies every battle. Survive escalating waves and complete critical objectives before reinforcements are overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found Footage Combat Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through intense missions as if you're inside a military-grade bodycam recording. Visual distortions, audio glitches, and UI overlays enhance the sense of realism and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Weather Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through dynamic rainstorms, sand clouds, and thick fog \u2014 impacting visibility, sound, and enemy tracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter Zones</strong><br>Every map contains <strong>dynamic spawns</strong>, <strong>shifting objectives</strong>, and <strong>roaming bosses</strong>, making each run unpredictable and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Hammerbuck Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807670/e0f26a584a59